{"id":"514ffe6f762a37f2","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-nisan-space-prg.md","title":"Nisan 对数平方种子空间生成器","display":"thm-nisan-space-prg — Nisan 对数平方种子空间生成器","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-nisan-space-prg","aliases":["28-thm-nisan-space-prg"],"display":"thm-nisan-space-prg — Nisan 对数平方种子空间生成器","depends_on":["[[28-df-space-bounded-prg]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]"],"source_book_location":"Theorem 21.31","source_printed_pages":"449–453","source_pdf_pages":"475–479","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-nisan-space-prg"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-nisan-space-prg</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-nisan-space-prg — Nisan 对数平方种子空间生成器"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c35eaa9794525bdd\" href=\"?note=c35eaa9794525bdd\" title=\"28-df-space-bounded-prg\">28-df-space-bounded-prg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Theorem 21.31"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"449–453"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"475–479"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SpacePRG}\">\\(\\operatorname{SpacePRG}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c35eaa9794525bdd\" href=\"?note=c35eaa9794525bdd\" title=\"28-df-space-bounded-prg\">28-df-space-bounded-prg</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>，其中函数的输入与输出均为单个二进制字串。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_n=\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\">\\(\\ell_n=\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\quad\\left[\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^{c\\ell_n^2}\\;g(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(1^n,z))\\in\\Sigma^{n^d}\\;\\land\\;\\operatorname{SpacePRG}\\left(\\left.(z\\mapsto g(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(1^n,z)))\\right|_{\\Sigma^{c\\ell_n^2}};n^d,n^d,1/10\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\quad\\left[\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^{c\\ell_n^2}\\;g(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(1^n,z))\\in\\Sigma^{n^d}\\;\\land\\;\\operatorname{SpacePRG}\\left(\\left.(z\\mapsto g(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(1^n,z)))\\right|_{\\Sigma^{c\\ell_n^2}};n^d,n^d,1/10\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^n\">\\(1^n\\)</span> 与种子通过本书已有的单射配对函数编码，故生成器调用属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 的一元字符串接口；此处没有另行假定一个未定义的二元函数类。</p>\n<p>采用分层配置图版本，宽度和步数都至多 n^d；时间层展开后的总配置数至多 (T+1)w≤2n^{2d}，因此先对原书定理使用较大的固定参数（例如 2d+2），再截取生成器输出的前 T=n^d 位；多余时间用吸收状态补齐。固定参数扩大只改变种子常数 c，仍为 O(log²n)。不足长度可用停机吸收状态补齐，不改变输出分布。原书取 c log²n 的渐近种子长度，此处向上取整并用 n+2 统一小输入。已核对生成器 O(log²n) 种子和统一多项式时间界；重用随机性引理与递归误差累计的完整证明未独立核验。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 21.31；印刷页 449–453；PDF 页 475–479。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-space-bounded-prg","status":"resolved","id":"c35eaa9794525bdd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-space-bounded-prg]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-space-bounded-prg","status":"resolved","i